1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Fourth Episode
The Madness of Moose

15
00:02:20,741 --> 00:02:24,017
All our Kings of the past
were strong and courageous!

16
00:02:24,061 --> 00:02:27,053
And all were capable
of performing exceptional feats!

17
00:02:29,301 --> 00:02:32,293
Look! Look at these Kings,
how brave they were!

18
00:02:54,541 --> 00:02:58,534
How beautiful and courageous
were the Kings of the past!

19
00:02:58,941 --> 00:03:02,172
Certainly! I told you,
they were the bravest in the world.

20
00:03:02,221 --> 00:03:04,132
Look at how strong this one was!

21
00:03:22,461 --> 00:03:26,249
- And that one there? - He caught
that big whale all by himself!

22
00:03:33,901 --> 00:03:35,812
Bravo! Bravo!

23
00:03:40,781 --> 00:03:44,899
The Kings of old fought
against dragons with only a sword!

24
00:03:45,301 --> 00:03:48,771
And when the Kings of ancient times
fought against a lion,

25
00:03:48,821 --> 00:03:51,335
they carried only a
single tiny spear!

26
00:03:51,821 --> 00:03:55,370
As you can see, the Kings of old
were strong and very courageous.

27
00:03:55,501 --> 00:03:58,413
- And what is Prince Sapphire like?
- Well...

28
00:03:58,701 --> 00:04:01,579
Well... He... Actually...

29
00:04:02,021 --> 00:04:04,012
Tell me, Nylon!

30
00:04:04,541 --> 00:04:07,260
Sapphire will be our next King,
won't he?

31
00:04:07,301 --> 00:04:09,371
Is he also strong and courageous?

32
00:04:10,101 --> 00:04:13,377
No, no, not at all! Sapphire is
neither strong nor courageous!

33
00:04:13,421 --> 00:04:15,981
- Why?
- Because he has never performed...

34
00:04:16,021 --> 00:04:19,570
...an achievement so important
that it can be displayed in here.

35
00:04:19,621 --> 00:04:21,612
So he is not as good as he seems!

36
00:04:23,341 --> 00:04:25,901
No, Princess Sapphire,
please stay calm!

37
00:04:25,941 --> 00:04:28,011
If you get angry, it will
be trouble for everyone!

38
00:04:28,101 --> 00:04:30,934
It's better if you go over
there, I'll keep an eye on them!

39
00:04:31,141 --> 00:04:33,132
He seems strong!

40
00:04:33,421 --> 00:04:35,412
But in reality, he is weak!

41
00:04:36,341 --> 00:04:39,333
Hurray!
Sapphire is not strong at all!

42
00:04:39,421 --> 00:04:41,412
Sapphire is weak!

43
00:04:44,581 --> 00:04:46,492
Sapphire is weak!

44
00:04:50,181 --> 00:04:53,730
- Weak Sapphire has arrived!
- What?!

45
00:04:55,381 --> 00:04:58,578
Nylon said that you are
not as brave as you seem.

46
00:04:58,901 --> 00:05:00,892
What are you saying?

47
00:05:01,101 --> 00:05:04,218
Welcome, Princess Sapphire
and Doctor Uranaru.

48
00:05:04,621 --> 00:05:08,614
Nylon, why do you say that I am not
as brave as I seem?

49
00:05:09,021 --> 00:05:11,012
Well, I only said...

50
00:05:11,061 --> 00:05:13,973
...that you haven't had a chance
to prove your courage.

51
00:05:14,021 --> 00:05:17,058
Nylon! I will never forgive you
if you say unkind things...

52
00:05:17,101 --> 00:05:19,057
...about
Princess Sapphire!

53
00:05:19,101 --> 00:05:22,138
So, Princess Sapphire,
why don't you try to prove...

54
00:05:22,181 --> 00:05:25,730
...your courage to Plastic?
- Prove my courage?!

55
00:05:25,981 --> 00:05:30,293
There is a deer named Moose who lives
in the forest near the castle.

56
00:05:30,821 --> 00:05:34,131
He is no ordinary deer; he is huge!

57
00:05:34,221 --> 00:05:38,134
Not only that! When hunters
go looking for animals,

58
00:05:38,421 --> 00:05:42,300
he suddenly appears
and attacks them!

59
00:05:42,581 --> 00:05:45,015
He always wins and then leaves!

60
00:05:45,181 --> 00:05:47,775
It is said that now
everyone is afraid of him...

61
00:05:47,821 --> 00:05:49,812
...and they stay away from the forest.

62
00:05:51,581 --> 00:05:54,220
So, do you want to defeat
the great deer?

63
00:05:54,261 --> 00:05:58,254
I didn't know there was
such a deer in the forest! All right, I'll do it!

64
00:06:01,741 --> 00:06:03,732
Opal, come here!

65
00:06:06,901 --> 00:06:08,812
Run to the forest immediately!

66
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:25,850
- Sapphire! Where are you going?
- Hi, Tink, I was looking for you

67
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:28,620
Is that the forest
where a deer named Moose lives?

68
00:06:28,700 --> 00:06:31,454
Moose...?
Yes, this is it!

69
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:34,618
- Opal, let's go!
- Sapphire, wait! No!

70
00:06:37,140 --> 00:06:40,451
I wonder why Sapphire
is going to that place. It's dangerous!

71
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:42,731
If Moose attacks him
he will hurt him!

72
00:06:48,740 --> 00:06:53,417
It's very dark in the forest! Opal,
stay here, I'll look for him by myself!

73
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:08,536
Hey, hello! Do you know Moose?

74
00:07:10,580 --> 00:07:13,220
Hey, do you know Moose?

75
00:07:14,580 --> 00:07:17,140
But it's strange! Why is
everyone running away?

76
00:07:20,180 --> 00:07:23,890
Don't hurt me, please!
Help! Help!

77
00:07:27,580 --> 00:07:31,699
Now I'll teach you to laugh!
Wait! Wait!

78
00:07:36,740 --> 00:07:38,220
Go!

79
00:07:41,140 --> 00:07:43,132
Don't do it anymore!

80
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:53,059
You are Moose, right? Because of you, no
one can come into the woods anymore!

81
00:07:53,100 --> 00:07:55,251
I have come to defeat you!

82
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:04,936
Where did he go? I don't
want him to get away!

83
00:08:10,580 --> 00:08:12,572
How big you are!

84
00:08:53,341 --> 00:08:56,299
Princess Sapphire might be in danger!

85
00:08:56,781 --> 00:09:00,171
I'm worried!
I'm worried!

86
00:09:02,701 --> 00:09:04,612
Here she comes back!

87
00:09:09,141 --> 00:09:12,053
Princess Sapphire, did
you encounter the deer?

88
00:09:12,101 --> 00:09:15,571
Yes! And he knocked me to the ground
with a blow from his horns!

89
00:09:16,341 --> 00:09:18,901
Well, I'm sorry,
Princess Sapphire.

90
00:09:18,941 --> 00:09:22,490
Not even you can defeat him!
But if I had been there...

91
00:09:22,581 --> 00:09:24,890
You wouldn't have been able to do
anything at all,

92
00:09:24,941 --> 00:09:27,660
because Moose's head alone
is this big!

93
00:09:28,301 --> 00:09:30,815
What?! His head is this big?!

94
00:09:34,621 --> 00:09:38,614
So, Prince Sapphire,
did you manage to kill Moose?

95
00:09:38,661 --> 00:09:42,449
He's still alive in the woods. I'm letting him
live for a few more days.

96
00:09:42,501 --> 00:09:46,130
Ah, I see! It's not that by any chance
you're a little afraid of him, right?

97
00:09:46,341 --> 00:09:48,730
- Me, afraid?!
- I mean... what I mean is.

98
00:09:48,901 --> 00:09:51,176
If you don't manage to kill him
what will you do?

99
00:09:51,221 --> 00:09:53,291
I will defeat him
without using my sword!

100
00:09:53,341 --> 00:09:56,538
But when I've defeated him
what will you do?

101
00:09:56,581 --> 00:10:00,415
Well, I'll stand on top of the tower
like a flag! Like this! Look!

102
00:10:05,861 --> 00:10:09,251
Very interesting!
In the meantime, start practicing.

103
00:10:09,461 --> 00:10:12,533
Princess Sapphire, let's go,
you must rest!

104
00:10:14,381 --> 00:10:18,215
Are you sure you did the right thing
by promising him such a thing?

105
00:10:18,261 --> 00:10:20,570
Sapphire might even be
capable of defeating Moose!

106
00:10:20,621 --> 00:10:22,498
Don't worry!

107
00:10:25,341 --> 00:10:28,174
- I have a way to avoid it!
- What is it?

108
00:10:28,261 --> 00:10:32,174
Be careful! If you touch
the tip you will go mad!

109
00:10:33,701 --> 00:10:36,215
It will be enough just
to hit him anywhere...

110
00:10:36,261 --> 00:10:39,094
..with this poisonous arrow
that the natives of Africa use!

111
00:10:40,101 --> 00:10:42,092
Let me handle everything!

112
00:11:33,621 --> 00:11:37,660
- I can't take it anymore!
- Princess Sapphire, are you alright?

113
00:11:37,701 --> 00:11:40,534
The sun is almost high,
it would be time to stop!

114
00:11:40,781 --> 00:11:42,658
One more time!

115
00:11:42,701 --> 00:11:45,010
But I'm sorry to throw
you to the ground again!

116
00:11:45,061 --> 00:11:47,017
One more time!

117
00:12:06,741 --> 00:12:10,700
- Oh, no!
- Is everything alright, Princess?

118
00:12:15,341 --> 00:12:17,252
The way things are going, I understand.

119
00:12:17,301 --> 00:12:19,974
.. ...that I cannot defeat
Moose, at least not with a sword!

120
00:12:38,181 --> 00:12:40,251
Send out more and more smoke!

121
00:12:41,301 --> 00:12:44,657
- We are ready, Mr. Nylon.
- Alright, begin!

122
00:12:49,981 --> 00:12:52,541
But what are you doing?
Don't stop!

123
00:12:52,661 --> 00:12:54,652
Hurry and send the smoke
into the woods!

124
00:12:54,701 --> 00:12:57,090
We need to drive the animals
out, do you understand?

125
00:13:34,861 --> 00:13:37,580
Soon that cursed Moose
will appear! Are you ready?

126
00:13:44,741 --> 00:13:47,619
Kill him..! Surround him...
Don't let him escape..!

127
00:14:13,981 --> 00:14:15,972
But this is truly a monster!

128
00:14:16,021 --> 00:14:18,899
But no monster
could climb up this far!

129
00:14:20,301 --> 00:14:23,259
When he is hit by the
arrow, he will go mad!

130
00:14:49,421 --> 00:14:52,094
And now, go as wild
as you like!

131
00:15:04,901 --> 00:15:08,610
Now I really want to see
how Sapphire will catch him!

132
00:15:09,341 --> 00:15:12,413
If he should meet him, furious
as he is, he will tear him to pieces!

133
00:15:29,621 --> 00:15:31,498
Here comes Moose!

134
00:15:35,301 --> 00:15:37,576
Hello, Moose, where are
you going in such a hurry?

135
00:15:37,621 --> 00:15:39,612
Watch out for the sheep!

136
00:15:52,701 --> 00:15:56,819
My God!
What is this shiny thing?

137
00:16:07,421 --> 00:16:10,060
What happened to Moose?
He seems to have gone mad!

138
00:16:20,981 --> 00:16:23,620
Moose is running wild
through the whole city...

139
00:16:23,661 --> 00:16:25,777
...and the soldiers
cannot stop him!

140
00:16:26,141 --> 00:16:29,770
So we would like you to come
and try, Princess Sapphire!

141
00:16:29,981 --> 00:16:34,532
Just in time! I have just finished
devising a way to kill him!

142
00:16:34,581 --> 00:16:38,017
If Moose has two horns, well...
I will have three swords!

143
00:16:38,381 --> 00:16:40,372
But not three hands!

144
00:16:41,421 --> 00:16:45,096
Fine! Do you perhaps intend
to throw the swords at him?

145
00:16:45,381 --> 00:16:49,772
Don't worry, my idea
will work! Let's go, Opal!

146
00:16:51,421 --> 00:16:53,412
Good luck!

147
00:16:54,821 --> 00:16:56,857
Yeah, she'll need a lot of it!

148
00:17:42,781 --> 00:17:45,500
He's arrived,
but he's destroying the city

149
00:18:03,701 --> 00:18:06,420
Come, Moose!
This time I'll get you!

150
00:18:44,261 --> 00:18:46,138
Sapphire!

151
00:18:49,021 --> 00:18:51,012
Sapphire!

152
00:19:02,181 --> 00:19:05,298
Don't kill him!
Remove the arrow he has on his neck!

153
00:19:13,341 --> 00:19:17,016
Arrow?! I think Tink
said to pull out an arrow!

154
00:19:17,901 --> 00:19:19,892
Ah, there it is!

155
00:19:44,461 --> 00:19:48,977
Sapphire!
Hurry and bring some ropes!

156
00:19:51,541 --> 00:19:53,611
Bring more!

157
00:19:58,821 --> 00:20:00,732
Hey, you!

158
00:20:00,981 --> 00:20:03,859
Quickly, tie the other end
to the tree!

159
00:20:23,101 --> 00:20:25,661
Sapphire!
Sapphire, hold on tight!

160
00:20:51,981 --> 00:20:55,371
Come on, Moose, open your eyes!
Sapphire has removed the arrow!

161
00:20:55,421 --> 00:20:57,412
Now it's all over!

162
00:21:08,341 --> 00:21:10,332
Listen, Moose..

163
00:21:11,261 --> 00:21:14,617
A bad man shot
a poisoned arrow at you,

164
00:21:14,661 --> 00:21:16,652
but she helped you.

165
00:21:18,621 --> 00:21:20,930
She is telling you to forgive him.

166
00:21:21,381 --> 00:21:23,975
I am the one who must apologize to you...

167
00:21:24,021 --> 00:21:26,535
...because I intended
to kill you.

168
00:21:36,581 --> 00:21:42,816
Hurray! Hurray!

169
00:21:44,541 --> 00:21:48,534
Did you see? He captured Moose!
Now you will have to keep your promise!

170
00:21:49,181 --> 00:21:53,299
Oh, no! I am sure I shot
the arrow hitting him in the neck!

171
00:21:53,341 --> 00:21:55,571
Quick, you idiot!
Go be the flag..

172
00:21:55,621 --> 00:21:58,340
...on top of that tower!
- Let me try again!

173
00:22:01,261 --> 00:22:05,174
I have another arrow! If I shoot it
at Moose, Sapphire will fall and die!

174
00:22:06,421 --> 00:22:09,060
Hurray!

175
00:22:09,101 --> 00:22:11,012
Princess!

176
00:22:11,301 --> 00:22:13,212
Nylon!

177
00:22:26,341 --> 00:22:29,094
Watch out!
No! Wait!

178
00:22:29,181 --> 00:22:31,695
Wait, I didn't want to hit you!
Help!

179
00:22:33,021 --> 00:22:35,330
Help! Help! Wait!

180
00:23:12,661 --> 00:23:16,131
It's just as I thought.
Sapphire is not weak at all!

181
00:23:16,181 --> 00:23:19,093
You're right! He will be
a strong and brave King!

182
00:23:22,101 --> 00:23:26,856
Princess Sapphire, will Moose have
returned safe and sound to the forest?

183
00:23:26,901 --> 00:23:29,495
That's exactly what I was thinking.

184
00:23:31,221 --> 00:23:34,258
And now, Moose..
Take care of yourself!

185
00:24:05,181 --> 00:24:08,801
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

186
00:24:08,802 --> 00:24:12,162
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

187
00:24:12,163 --> 00:24:15,933
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

188
00:24:15,934 --> 00:24:19,095
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

189
00:24:19,096 --> 00:24:22,909
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

190
00:24:22,910 --> 00:24:26,206
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

191
00:24:26,207 --> 00:24:30,212
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

192
00:24:30,213 --> 00:24:33,651
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

193
00:24:33,652 --> 00:24:37,272
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

194
00:24:37,273 --> 00:24:40,633
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

195
00:24:40,634 --> 00:24:44,404
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

196
00:24:44,405 --> 00:24:47,566
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

